  "description": "The native payload for Agora's local face detection extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. Reports whether a face is in frame and how far away it is — used to auto-adjust exposure and capture, or to pause the stream when nobody is there. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.EnableFaceDetection in the RTC binding.",
